            "value": "Xu, X. S., Lin, L., Papelis, C., & Xu, P. (2018). Sorption of Arsenic from Desalination Concentrate onto Drinking Water Treatment Solids: Operating Conditions and Kinetics. Water, 10(2). http://doi.org/10.3390/w10020096",
